OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper forced to pay #45m over
OL,4,Afire safety works
OL,5,
OL,6,FA building developer has been ordered
OL,7,Fto pay more than #45m to the government
OL,8,Fafter fire safety defects were repaired
OL,9,Fin seven high-rise buildings.
OL,11,FThe buildings in Manchester, developed
OL,12,Fby Urban Splash between 2000 and 2008,
OL,13,Fwere alleged to have serious defects
OL,14,Fdiscovered in inspections after the
OL,15,FGrenfell Tower disaster.
OL,17,FThe extent of the defects was disputed
OL,18,Fbut they have been fixed at a cost of
OL,19,Fmore than #60m, with about #51.1m paid
OL,20,Ffrom the government's Building Safety
OL,21,FFund (BSF) established after the
OL,22,Fdisaster.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
