OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper forced to pay #45m over
OL,4,Afire safety works
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe buildings were not owned by Urban
OL,7,FSplash at the time of the remediation
OL,8,Fwork and no BSF money was paid to it. A
OL,9,Fspokesperson said the scale of the
OL,10,Fliability was "significant".
